# Decided once for the whole repo (PR #7 note, PR #6 measurement, PR #9): bash
# executes the shell helpers on Unix and Git Bash alike — a CRLF checkout breaks
# shebangs and traps grep anchors. Measured 2026-08-04 on Windows: the Workflow
# tool also rejects a CRLF workflow script outright ("script contains control
# characters"), which takes every workflow in workflows/ out of service there.
# The class is "text we execute", not one extension — so pin all text, once.
* text=auto eol=lf
